      "content": "wait really?? that sounds kinda scary lol. i didnt think it was anything serious. i mean i've been under a lot of stress at work lately and i havent been eating great, so maybe its just my body reacting to that? could i just try taking some extra pedialyte and resting for a few days to see if it clears up before i go to a doctor?",
